            {
                "date": "2021-07-23",
                "text": "An effect that says \"choose a target, then roll a d20\" or similar still uses the normal process of putting an ability on the stack and resolving it. Choosing targets is part of putting the ability on the stack and rolling the d20 happens later, as the ability resolves."
